  "notes": "Locally the 12 years are Primaria (6 courses in three two-year cycles), ESO (4) and Bachillerato (2). Intermediate vocational training (FP de Grado Medio) is the alternative to Bachillerato. Regions with a co-official language may use it for class names (e.g. Catalan 1r d'ESO); the structure is the same nationwide."
